{"4870960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Fame Game II: L.A. Heartbreaker", "steam_appid": 4870960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5001390], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/9645d91067f581f2ec128b2441836828.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by a professional team with experience in Hollywood film and television, The Fame Game II is crafted to feature-film standards across direction, cinematography, lighting, costume, makeup, and production design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filmed on location at landmarks across Los Angeles, the city's unmistakable light and atmosphere become part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/5d3b76c7cfb864c66264a8dab069302b.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200,000 player votes helped shape the cast, led by Zhong Chenyao as Ayaka. Five actresses bring every relationship, secret, and emotional turning point to life through live-action performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/38bacf3479682cce8b448626516503eb.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are He Shuhan, an ordinary international student—until a deal lands you at the gates of a Los Angeles mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You put on a tailored three-piece suit. You learn how to hold a champagne flute. You step into the life of someone born to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city respects only winners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And winners never ask where you came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mask you cannot remove. Designer clothes you must learn to wear. Lies delivered at exactly the right moment. Five dangerous relationships balanced on a knife’s edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, you have almost everyone fooled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/352af03ac2bf6cff8279abc486f3fcbf.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/e8ccbcf76dd8caf3f861d29671a96e31.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has already decided that you are her fiancé. She says it with the sweetest innocence—and the certainty of someone who will not take no for an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her love is less a romance than a kidnapping, and there is no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f2a4e230852b92e7a6b9d9f25394f209.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the only person who sees straight through your disguise—and the only one who has never tried to expose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/baf955eca216d69c855d732bcf7d7b38.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tender moment comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is not falling for you. She is falling for the wealthy heir she believes you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/4919e039630edaa51a9891ed2beba749.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She knows every secret that could destroy you, threatening you one moment and protecting you the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one understands what it means to live as an impostor better than she does—and no one is harder to read.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/d91469599e2c6448ed307f46df49535c.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the first to notice the cracks in your story—and still chooses to cover for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can never tell: does she see a younger brother who needs protecting… or a man she cannot afford to let too close?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/6d882c04fc469a656a940cbde791ad40.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNDREDS OF CHOICES. COUNTLESS CONSEQUENCES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lie demands another lie to protect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw money around like a real heir, or tear off the mask with a single choice and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some keep the performance going until the very end. Some are crushed by debt and left on the streets. Some are killed when the underworld turns against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And some, after every disguise is gone, find someone waiting to catch them—someone who knew the truth all along and never said a word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest danger is not being exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is playing the role so well that even you can no longer tell which self is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identity is the game. Your heart is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/9645d91067f581f2ec128b2441836828.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brought to life by a professional team with experience in Hollywood film and television, The Fame Game II is crafted to feature-film standards across direction, cinematography, lighting, costume, makeup, and production design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filmed on location at landmarks across Los Angeles, the city's unmistakable light and atmosphere become part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/c7c97c2fef5f90dc5b617c9f7a1e302c.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/5d3b76c7cfb864c66264a8dab069302b.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 200,000 player votes helped shape the cast, led by Zhong Chenyao as Ayaka. Five actresses bring every relationship, secret, and emotional turning point to life through live-action performances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/2d245fe9e6796ce57bd209b858529a7f.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/38bacf3479682cce8b448626516503eb.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are He Shuhan, an ordinary international student—until a deal lands you at the gates of a Los Angeles mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You put on a tailored three-piece suit. You learn how to hold a champagne flute. You step into the life of someone born to wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This city respects only winners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And winners never ask where you came from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mask you cannot remove. Designer clothes you must learn to wear. Lies delivered at exactly the right moment. Five dangerous relationships balanced on a knife’s edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before long, you have almost everyone fooled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/65bb1dffe93a48230224d898f04a221d.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/352af03ac2bf6cff8279abc486f3fcbf.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f47f3d59c0d1961eef3f0c4fe9a126fa.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/e8ccbcf76dd8caf3f861d29671a96e31.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has already decided that you are her fiancé. She says it with the sweetest innocence—and the certainty of someone who will not take no for an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her love is less a romance than a kidnapping, and there is no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/753e79081ca3a635accdefa20bda0941.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f2a4e230852b92e7a6b9d9f25394f209.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the only person who sees straight through your disguise—and the only one who has never tried to expose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/59734d0fad9a907d436af96480e48383.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/baf955eca216d69c855d732bcf7d7b38.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tender moment comes with a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is not falling for you. She is falling for the wealthy heir she believes you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/f1c27a207e424d8bdd5e57614d9c2fa5.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/4919e039630edaa51a9891ed2beba749.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She knows every secret that could destroy you, threatening you one moment and protecting you the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one understands what it means to live as an impostor better than she does—and no one is harder to read.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/bc84a3ef80dc2a0764ce13f9dd6b5ab4.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/d91469599e2c6448ed307f46df49535c.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the first to notice the cracks in your story—and still chooses to cover for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you can never tell: does she see a younger brother who needs protecting… or a man she cannot afford to let too close?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/a028e4b62ccae3e9c8426753847b8179.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/6d882c04fc469a656a940cbde791ad40.avif?t=1788233984\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNDREDS OF CHOICES. COUNTLESS CONSEQUENCES.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every lie demands another lie to protect it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw money around like a real heir, or tear off the mask with a single choice and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some keep the performance going until the very end. Some are crushed by debt and left on the streets. Some are killed when the underworld turns against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And some, after every disguise is gone, find someone waiting to catch them—someone who knew the truth all along and never said a word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest danger is not being exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is playing the role so well that even you can no longer tell which self is real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identity is the game. Your heart is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.poster.avif?t=1788233984\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.webm?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4870960/extras/1f494e7c9a7fefb0260f31e0de308c8b.mp4?t=1788233984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Shot across Los Angeles by a team with Hollywood experience, this live-action interactive drama stars Zhong Chenyao as Ayaka, with a cast shaped by 200,000+ votes. As a cash-strapped student posing as 